  "body_text": "96 \r\n Go behind the headlines, and get a front row seat to today’s biggest newsmakers \r\n \r\n \r\n 🎥 On the season three preview of \"The Axios Show,\"&nbsp; Hasan Piker sits down with Axios’ Alex Thompson for a wide-ranging interview on his role in Democratic politics, his past incendiary rhetoric, U.S. foreign policy, Israel and Gaza and his views on China. Piker also weighs in on Michigan Senate candidate Abdul El-Sayed (D), AOC and 2028, Charlie Kirk and Iran’s nuclear ambitions.\r\n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Watch Now \r\n \r\n Catch up quick : “The Axios Show” is our series featuring top Axios reporters interviewing newsmakers shaping politics, business, tech, and culture. \n\n \r\n 🇺🇸 President Donald Trump with Axios’ Marc Caputo \r\n 🗳️ Gov. Gavin Newsom (D-Calif.) with Axios' Alex Thompson \r\n📚 Podcast host & best-selling author Mel Robbins with Axios CEO Jim VandeHei \r\n 🪖 Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky with Axios' Barak Ravid \r\n 🏦 JPMorgan Chase chairman and CEO Jamie Dimon with Axios CEO Jim VandeHei \r\n 👀 You can watch all episodes of “The Axios Show” on a xios.com , YouTube , and X , with buzzy moments published on Instagram .&nbsp; \r\n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Pro tip: Follow Axios on YouTube and X to be notified when new episodes drop. \r\n\n &#8202; \r\n Contact Us \n\r\n Update Preferences \n Unsubscribe \n\n \r\n Contact Us \n Update Preferences \n\r\n Unsubscribe \n\n PO Box 101060\n\r\nArlington VA 22201\n\n \r\n PO Box 101060 \n Arlington VA 22201 \n\n \r\n Facebook \n\r\n X \n Instagram \n\n LinkedIn \n\n \r\n Facebook \n X \n\r\n Instagram \n\n LinkedIn",
